 a dark diagonal. Row 2 right: the recurring mint-shirt girl standing and showing exactly one large red diamond kite drawn on a white page, with two seated friends looking at the page. Row 3 left: same girl pointing directly to a solid yellow swatch; on her other side a white page with one red diamond kite, a small purple and a small green swatch sit away from her fingertip. Red kite and yellow choice are visually distinct. Row 3 middle: left-to-right story strip of three unambiguous actions, same girl first bent over drawing with crayon, then facing a friend and pointing to the shared paper, then upright facing several listeners holding her drawing aloft; three small pictures separated by slim cream spaces. Row 3 right: same girl holding her picture toward a parent at a warm home table, parent clearly listening, pencil and small blank sheet with a few simple tally marks, cozy home. No material from any existing book, no printed captions, do not rearrange the cells.",
